    "purpose": "Representation-overlap and error-correlation audit between the learned CircularConvEncoder v3 embedding and each hand-designed Level-1 feature (DFT, AC, RL-C9, RL-C6), on the identical 299-test-identity / 1998-gallery / 2488-de-duplicated-probe protocol as all_features_nn_testsplit_comparison.json / audit_nn_v3_dedup_metrics.json / audit_all_features_dedup_testsplit.json.",
